; An inverter and its bench on analogLib, as SfyExport writes them (spec interop.md §4.2).
("sfyx" 1 "SfyExport test")
("lib" "analogLib")
("cell" "gnd" "ref")
("cv" "symbol" "schematicSymbol" 160)
("term" "gnd!" "inputOutput" "")
("pinfig" 1 "gnd!" -2 -2 2 2)
